{"root":"hendak","ipa":"/hənˈdak/","core":"想要，打算，将要","pos":["动词","虚词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/hənˈdak/","zh":"表示意愿、计划或即将发生的动作，常用于正式场合或书面语，也可作为助动词表示将来时。","phrases":[{"t":"hendak pergi","zh":"想要去"},{"t":"apa yang hendak dicapai","zh":"想要达到的目标"},{"t":"hendak tidak hendak","zh":"无论如何，不管愿不愿意"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia hendak membeli mobil baru bulan depan.","zh":"他打算下个月买一辆新车。"},{"t":"Hujan hendak turun.","zh":"快要下雨了。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"hendak","ipa":"/hənˈdak/","zh":"想要，打算","phrase":{"t":"hendak pulang","zh":"想要回家"},"example":{"t":"Saya hendak berbicara dengan Anda.","zh":"我想和你谈谈。"}},{"w":"kehendak","ipa":"/kəhənˈdak/","zh":"意愿，意志，愿望","phrase":{"t":"kehendak Tuhan","zh":"上帝的旨意"},"example":{"t":"Itu bukan kehendak saya.","zh":"那不是我的意愿。"}},{"w":"menghendaki","ipa":"/məŋhənˈdaki/","zh":"想要，要求，期望","phrase":{"t":"menghendaki perubahan","zh":"期望改变"},"example":{"t":"Pemerintah menghendaki partisipasi aktif warga.","zh":"政府要求公民积极参与。"}},{"w":"dikehendaki","ipa":"/dikəhənˈdaki/","zh":"被要求，被期望","phrase":{"t":"seperti yang dikehendaki","zh":"如所期望的那样"},"example":{"t":"Hasilnya tidak sesuai dengan yang dikehendaki.","zh":"结果与预期的不符。"}}],"derSlugs":["hendak","kehendak","menghendaki","dikehendaki"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:30:15.648Z","src":"base"}